rnshala","experience":"3 year(s)","is_walkin":false},{"title":"SAP EWM Technical Consultant","company":"ITC Infotech","location":"Bangalore","date_posted":"2026-09-16","url":"https://internshala.com/job/detail/sap-ewm-technical-consultant-job-in-bangalore-at-itc-infotech1788136959","source":"internshala","experience":"2 year(s)","is_walkin":false},{"title":"Guidewire Claim Center Specialist","company":"Tata Consultancy Services","location":"Bangalore","date_posted":"2026-09-16","url":"https://internshala.com/job/detail/guidewire-claim-center-specialist-job-in-bangalore-at-tata-consultancy-services1788654779","source":"internshala","experience":"2 year(s)","is_walkin":false},{"title":"Software Development Engineer In Test 1","company":"Signzy","location":"Bangalore","date_posted":"2026-07-03","url":"https://internshala.com/job/detail/fresher-software-development-engineer-in-test-1-job-in-bangalore-at-signzy1782458530"},{"title":"Associate Technical Support Engineer","company":"Chargepoint Technologies","location":"Bangalore","date_posted":"2026-07-03","url":"https://internshala.com/job/detail/fresher-associate-technical-support-engineer-job-in-bangalore-at-chargepoint-technologies1780859247"},{"title":"Growth Consultant","company":"GenAI People","location":"Bangalore","date_posted":"2026-07-10","url":"https://internshala.com/job/detail/fresher-growth-consultant-job-in-bangalore-at-genai-people1783680744"},{"title":"Key Account Manager","company":"NewWave Computing Private Limited","location":"Bangalore","date_posted":"2026-07-16","url":"https://internshala.com/job/detail/key-account-manager-job-in-bangalore-at-newwave-computing-private-limited1784162389","experience":"1 year(s)"},{"title":"Admissions Counselor","company":"Vidyashilp University","location":"Bangalore","date_posted":"2026-07-29","url":"https://internshala.com/job/detail/admissions-counselor-job-in-bangalore-at-vidyashilp-university1785310649","experience":"1 year(s)"},{"title":"Video Editor","company":"KaroStartup","location":"Bangalore","date_posted":"2026-07-29","url":"https://internshala.com/job/detail/fresher-video-editor-job-in-bangalore-at-karostartup1785310644","skills":[115,117],"description":"KaroStartup \u00b7 Bengaluru \u00b7 On\\-ground \\+ office \u00b7 Duration: 3\u20136 months\n\nABOUT KAROSTARTUP\n\nKaroStartup began in 2020 as a college Instagram page. Today it's a startup media platform with a 1M\\+ community and 100M\\+ cumulative views, built on telling real Indian business stories with real numbers.\n\nWe publish across LinkedIn, Instagram, YouTube and podcasts, and we also produce content for founders and brands we work with.\n\nBEFORE YOU APPLY\n\nTwo things this role requires that most editing roles don't: you must be based in Bengaluru and able to travel across the city, and you must own your own camera and shooting equipment. If either isn't true for you, this isn't the right role.\n\nPlease also apply with a showreel or drive link of work you have both shot and edited yourself.\n\nWHY THIS ROLE EXISTS\n\nA lot of our best content is shot outside the office \u2014 at a founder's office, at their factory, at their first store. Someone has to actually be in the room with the camera.\n\nThat's this role. You come with us to the founder's office, shoot the interview or the podcast or the short video, and then take the footage back and produce the finished piece yourself. One person, end to end \u2014 shoot to publish.\n\nWHAT YOU'LL DO \u2014 ON THE SHOOT\n\nTravel with the team to founder offices, stores, factories and events across Bengaluru \u2013 Shoot founder interviews, podcast episodes, short videos and on\\-ground content \u2013 Set up the frame, lighting and audio yourself \u2014 often in a small cabin or a noisy office, not a studio \u2013 Capture B\\-roll while you're there: the office, the product, the team, the details that make the story feel real. The edit is only as good as what you brought back. \u2013 Get it right the first time. A founder gives us an hour, and there is no second shoot.\n\nWHAT YOU'LL DO \u2014 BACK AT THE DESK\n\nEdit everything you shoot \u2014 full podcast episodes, reels, shorts, explainers and founder features \u2013 Cut long conversations down to the moments worth publishing, and turn each one into short\\-form \u2013 Own the first three seconds. Hooks, text\\-on\\-screen, pattern breaks. Retention is the metric that matters here. \u2013 Subtitles, sound design, transitions, basic motion graphics \u2014 the finishing layer that separates a decent edit from a good one \u2013 Use AI video tools to speed up the boring parts \u2014 transcription, auto\\-cuts, silence removal, voice cleanup, upscaling \u2013 Keep our fonts, colours, caption style and pacing consistent across every video without anyone having to check \u2013 Manage and back up footage properly. Clean file structure, findable six months later. \u2013 Look at the analytics afterwards \u2014 where people dropped off, which hook held \u2014 and change the next edit accordingly\n\nEQUIPMENT\n\nThis is a run\\-and\\-gun setup, not a film set. We are not looking for a Bollywood\\-scale production \u2014 we're looking for someone who can walk into an office with a bag and come out with usable footage.\n\nYou should own and be comfortable operating:\n\nMUST HAVE\n\nBased in Bengaluru and able to travel across the city for shoots \u2013 Your own camera and shooting kit, as above \u2013 Practical shooting ability \u2014 framing, lighting and audio in real, imperfect locations \u2013 Adobe Premiere Pro, or an equivalent suite, with a strong working command \u2013 CapCut, or similar, for fast short\\-form turnaround \u2013 Ability to handle both long\\-form and short\\-form edits \u2014 these are different crafts and we need both \u2013 Good sense of pacing, rhythm and music selection, and clean audio work \u2013 Comfortable with AI\\-assisted editing tools, and curious about new ones \u2013 Ownership \u2014 you close the loop and hit deadlines without being chased\n\nGOOD TO HAVE\n\n\u2013 Multicam podcast experience \u2014 sync, angles, cutting between speakers \u2013 After Effects for motion graphics and animated text \u2013 Photoshop or Canva for thumbnails and covers \u2013 Basic colour grading \u2013 Understanding of what performs on Instagram and YouTube specifically \u2014 they are not the same platform \u2013 Comfortable talking to founders on set and making them relax on camera\n\nYOU'LL PROBABLY BE GOOD AT THIS IF\n\nYou watch a reel and instantly notice the framing, the cut, the caption timing, the sound design \u2013 You can walk into an unfamiliar room and figure out where to put the camera in two minutes \u2013 You can take a rough brief and come back with something better than what was described \u2013 You want to build a body of work, not just clear a task list\n\nTHE HONEST PART\n\nYou are the crew. There is no separate camera person, sound person and editor \u2014 on most shoots it's you and your bag, and then it's you at the timeline. That's the point of the role, and it is also the hard part of it.\n\nShoot days move around. Founders reschedule. Bengaluru traffic is real, and some weeks will have a podcast episode, a founder shoot and several reels in the same pipeline. Speed matters, and so does not letting quality slip when the queue is full.\n\nYou'll get feedback constantly, sometimes on individual frames and cuts. If you take that as collaboration rather than criticism, you'll grow fast here.\n\nWHAT YOU GET OUT OF IT\n\nYou'll be in the room with founders \u2014 not researching them from a laptop, but sitting across from them while they talk \u2013 Real ownership of video going out to a 1M\\+ audience, with your work published, not shelved \u2013 A portfolio of podcast episodes, founder features and reels that actually performed \u2014 shot and edited by you \u2013 Hands\\-on training in hooks, retention, storytelling and platform strategy, not just software \u2013 Certificate and letter of recommendation on completion \u2013 Strong performers are considered for a full\\-time role as the video team is built out\n\nWe are not looking for someone who only shoots, or someone who only edits. We are looking for one person who can walk into a founder's office with a camera and walk out with a story we can publish.\n\nPay: \u20b930,000\\.00 \\- \u20b950,000\\.00 per month\n\nBenefits:\n\n* Commuter assistance\n* Flexible schedule\n* Work from home\n\nWork Location: Hybrid remote in Bengaluru, Karnataka 560061"},{"title":"Junior Architects (Chennai) (0-2 Yrs)","company":"@ LOCUS","location":"Bangalore","date_posted":"2026-07-29","url":"https://internshala.com/job/detail/fresher-junior-architects-chennai-0-2-yrs-job-in-bangalore-at--locus1785310597"},{"title":"Tele Caller","company":"SM Developers Official","location":"Bangalore","date_posted":"2026-07-29","url":"https://internshala.com/job/detail/tele-caller-job-in-bangalore-at-sm-developers-official1785310583","experience":"3 year(s)"},{"title":"Junior Operations Executive","company":"Akshara Enterprises","location":"Bangalore","date_posted":"2026-07-31","url":"https://internshala.com/job/detail/fresher-junior-operations-executive-job-in-bangalore-at-akshara-enterprises1785500045"},{"title":"Customer Support Executive","company":"HuedLife","location":"Bangalore","date_posted":"2026-08-05","url":"https://internshala.com/job/detail/fresher-customer-support-executive-job-in-bangalore-at-huedlife1785920712"},{"title":"College Warden","company":"Bosscoder Academy","location":"Bangalore","date_posted":"2026-08-05","url":"https://internshala.com/job/detail/fresher-college-warden-job-in-bangalore-at-bosscoder-academy1785922169"},{"title":"Technical Content Creator & Editor","company":"IMatiz","location":"Bangalore","date_posted":"2026-08-06","url":"https://internshala.com/job/detail/fresher-technical-content-creator-editor-job-in-bangalore-at-imatiz1786012715"},{"title":"Cu